                <pb facs="0376" n="370" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg370"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Curry</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-04-21"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 21,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Has Cuban budget been presented to the Cortes, and does it contain Mora
                    claim?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bayard.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
